#11500
The Town of Shaden~
    This area is designed to be a small town of lawlessness, where aggro
nasty mobs wander around and wreak havoc.  There are no peacekeepers who
murder [KILLER]/[THIEF] flags, however.  The town also has a black
market which will fence almost any item and sells a few hard-to-get
items....if you have the gold.

Smythe
October 1996
~
